cond and fourth armies the armies  these are Brigade size they call them  armies but they've got a number of  brigades who are in reserve and they  might use those forces to push down from  zapparesia right down to malith Paul on  the coast in other words to open up a  third front in this offensive series of  offensives over the winter now if they  do that they will be relying on the  Colder Weather The Frozen Ground so that  their armor their track vehicles can  really make an impression we don't know  yet if they will do it of course but if  they did that would be another game  changer in their attempt to win back as  much territory as they've lost since the  24th of February it's a possibility I  guess we'll find out when the weather  turns colder and the ground really  freezes
 

